---
title: "AuthenticationHistory"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: greeting
  s1: response
  s2: tls request
  s3: validate token
  s4: rejected
  s5: request password
  s6: RSA request
  s7: encrypted password
  s8: plain password
  s9: verify password
  s10: accepted
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Server sends greeting
  s0 --> s2: Server sends greeting
  s1 --> s3: Client sends authentication response
  s2 --> s1: Client upgrades connection to TLS
  s3 --> s4: Initial token is invalid
  s3 --> s5: Initial token is valid
  s5 --> s6: Server requests full password
  s6 --> s4: Client sends invalid RSA request#59; server rejects it
  s6 --> s7: Client requests RSA key#59; server sends it
  s5 --> s8: Server requests full password
  s7 --> s9: Client sends full password
  s8 --> s9: Client sends full password
  s9 --> s4: Full password is rejected
  s9 --> s10: Full password is accepted
